# Build context hygiene for the beta images (docker/beta/*.Dockerfile).
#
# node_modules is excluded because dependencies are installed inside the image from the
# lockfile; copying a host tree in would defeat that and, in this workspace, would copy
# symlinks that dangle inside a container. dist is excluded so a stale host build can
# never end up shipped instead of the one the image compiles.
.git
**/node_modules
api/dist
spa/dist
api/.env
spa/tests/.compiled
qa-artifacts
**/.playwright-cli
# QA scratch written into the gitignored asset trees. `git status` cannot see it, so
# without this it rides into an image unnoticed - which is how five leftover files from
# the previous QA lane ended up baked into the first build of these images.
spa/assets/object/qa-*
spa/assets/avatars/qa-*
